# SQLite transient files.
# Keep *.db, *.sqlite, and *.sql so assignment deliverables can be committed
# under backend/Candidate.API/Database/Data/ and Database/Scripts/.
# Commit the database file only after connections are closed or from a consistent snapshot.
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-journal
